{
    "type": "entity",
    "name": "T50_Boot_Chain_Architecture",
    "entityType": "codeSnippet",
    "observations": [
        "=== T50 启动链架构 ===",
        "1. preloader → lk (Little Kernel) → kernel",
        "2. boot_a: 含kernel + generic ramdisk (header v4)",
        "3. vendor_boot_a: 含vendor ramdisk (PLATFORM fragment) + DTB (header v4)",
        "4. init_boot_a: 全零 (T50不使用GKI init_boot)",
        "5. 关键: vendor_boot不含kernel → TARGET_NO_KERNEL=true",
        "6. 关键: vendor_boot使用FOX_VENDOR_BOOT_RECOVERY模式",
        "7. MediaTek bootloader仅加载PLATFORM fragment, 不加载RECOVERY fragment",
        "8. DTB通过BOARD_MKBOOTIMG_ARGS --dtb传入"
    ]
}
{
    "type": "entity",
    "name": "T50_VendorBoot_Header_Structure",
    "entityType": "codeSnippet",
    "observations": [
        "=== vendor_boot v4 Header 结构 (MediaTek定制) ===",
        "magic: VNDRBOOT, header_version: 4, page_size: 4096",
        "kernel_addr: 0x40080000, ramdisk_addr: 0x47c80000",
        "tags_addr: 0x4bc80000, dtb_addr: 0x4bc80000",
        "cmdline: bootopt=64S3,32N2,64N2 androidboot.selinux=permissive",
        "header_size: 2128, dtb_size: 159622 bytes",
        "MTK非标准: cmdline总大小2024 bytes (非AOSP标准4096)",
        "MTK非标准: tags_addr字段存储vendor_ramdisk_size",
        "Stock镜像: 1个PLATFORM fragment (20.9MB), 0个RECOVERY fragment"
    ]
}
{
    "type": "entity",
    "name": "T50_BoardConfig_Critical_Config",
