        "TW_THEME := portrait_hdpi (OrangeFox R12.1无landscape_hdpi)",
        "TW_ROTATION := 270 (横屏显示)",
        "TW_BRIGHTNESS_PATH := /sys/class/leds/lcd-backlight/brightness",
        "TW_MAX_BRIGHTNESS := 255, TW_DEFAULT_BRIGHTNESS := 128"
    ]
}
{
    "type": "entity",
    "name": "T50_Bootloop_RootCause_And_Solution",
    "entityType": "codeSnippet",
    "observations": [
        "=== Bootloop 根因与解决方案 ===",
        "根因: MediaTek bootloader仅加载vendor_boot的PLATFORM ramdisk fragment",
        "问题: BOARD_INCLUDE_RECOVERY_RAMDISK_IN_VENDOR_BOOT:=true → AOSP创建RECOVERY fragment → PLATFORM为空 → bootloop",
        "最终方案: 保持true + repack_vendor_boot.py后处理合并为单一PLATFORM fragment",
        "repack逻辑: 解压stock PLATFORM + 解压OrangeFox RECOVERY → 合并 → 重打包",
        "参考: unihertz-jelly-max (MT6878), klee (MT6899)"
    ]
}
{
    "type": "entity",
    "name": "T50_Screen_Rotation_Fix",
    "entityType": "codeSnippet",
    "observations": [
        "=== 屏幕旋转修复 ===",
        "根因: OrangeFox R12.1不存在landscape_hdpi主题, TW_THEME=landscape_hdpi导致Theme selection failed",
        "修复: TW_THEME=portrait_hdpi + TW_ROTATION=270",
        "参考: GPD XD+ (MTK tablet) 使用portrait_hdpi + TW_ROTATION=270",
        "重要: TW_ROTATION只旋转图形, 触摸需RECOVERY_TOUCHSCREEN_*单独配置",
        "Commit: Device_Tree 3eec984"
    ]
}
{
    "type": "entity",
    "name": "T50_ADB_Fix",
    "entityType": "codeSnippet",
    "observations": [
        "=== ADB不可用修复 ===",
        "根因: init.recovery.*.rc中 on fs && property:ro.debuggable=0 → 条件永远不满足",
        "修复: 改为 on fs (移除property条件)",
        "原厂也有相同bug: MTK模板遗留问题"
    ]
}
{
    "type": "entity",
    "name": "T50_Envsetup_Fix",
    "entityType": "codeSnippet",
    "observations": [
        "=== envsetup.sh 假阳性退出码修复 ===",
        "根因: OrangeFox orangefox_envsetup()最后一行 [ -s .../vts/Android.mk ] && echo -n '' > ...",
        "TWRP minimal manifest中frameworks/base/.../Android.mk不存在 → [ -s ]返回1 → &&短路 → 函数返回1",
        "source envsetup.sh继承退出码1 → CI误判失败",
        "修复: source build/envsetup.sh 2>&1 || true + type -t lunch验证",
        "Commit: 主仓库 84df493"
    ]
}
{
    "type": "entity",
    "name": "T50_Common_Pitfalls",
    "entityType": "rejectionRecord",
    "observations": [
        "=== 常见陷阱 ===",
        "1. PRODUCT_STATIC_BOOT_CONTROL_HAL在AOSP12.1已obsolete",
        "2. BOARD_USES_RECOVERY_AS_BOOT与BOARD_USES_GENERIC_KERNEL_IMAGE不能同时true",
        "3. fastboot boot不适用于vendor_boot.img",
        "4. MTK vendor_boot header非标准",
        "5. Device_Tree是git submodule → 需分别提交",
        "6. CI是workflow_dispatch → 需手动触发",
        "7. TW_ROTATION只旋转图形, 触摸需单独配置",
        "8. OrangeFox R12.1只有portrait_hdpi和watch_mdpi主题",
        "9. envsetup.sh退出码1是假阳性, 必须||true + 验证lunch",
        "10. BOARD_PLAT_*_SEPOLICY_DIR deprecated是AOSP源码问题, 无法从Device_Tree修复"
    ]
}
